#: ../../repository.rst:1
msgid "Guidedog"
msgstr "Guidedog"

#: ../../repository.rst:4
msgid "**Write once. Explain well. Publish on the web and on paper.**"
msgstr "**एक बार लिखें। साफ़ समझाएँ। वेब और कागज़ पर प्रकाशित करें।**"

#: ../../repository.rst:6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Guidedog builds HTML documentation sites and PDF books from "
#| "reStructuredText and Markdown. It is written in Odin. Its conversion "
#| "engine is **Guidedoc**, and Typst typesets the PDF pages. No Python "
#| "environment or LaTeX installation is needed."
msgid ""
"Guidedog builds HTML documentation sites and PDF books from "
"reStructuredText and Markdown. It is written in Rust. Its conversion "
"engine is **Guidedoc**, and the embedded Typst compiler typesets the PDF "
"pages. No Python environment or LaTeX installation is needed."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog reStructuredText और Markdown से HTML दस्तावेज़ साइट और PDF "
"पुस्तकें बनाता है। यह Odin में लिखा गया है। इसके रूपांतरण इंजन का नाम "
"**Guidedoc** है और Typst PDF की पृष्ठ-सज्जा करता है। Python वातावरण या "
"LaTeX स्थापित करने की ज़रूरत नहीं है।"

#: ../../repository.rst:10
msgid ""
"Sphinx inspires the authoring workflow. Guidedog is an independent "
"system: configuration is declarative TOML, API extraction is static, and "
"Python configuration and extensions are never executed. Complete Sphinx "
"compatibility is not a goal."
msgstr ""
"लेखन की प्रक्रिया Sphinx से प्रेरित है, पर Guidedog एक स्वतंत्र प्रणाली "
"है। कॉन्फ़िगरेशन घोषणात्मक TOML में होता है और API का स्थिर विश्लेषण होता "
"है। Python कॉन्फ़िगरेशन या एक्सटेंशन कभी नहीं चलते। Sphinx से पूरी "
"अनुकूलता लक्ष्य नहीं है।"

#: ../../repository.rst:14
msgid ""
"This page is the repository overview. On GitHub, the ``README`` files at "
"the root of the repository give the same overview in each language of the "
"manual."
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:17
msgid "Start a project"
msgstr "परियोजना शुरू करें"

#: ../../repository.rst:27
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The project contains `conf.toml`, `index.rst`, "
#| "`_templates/layout.html`, `_templates/book.typ`, and `_static/`. "
#| "Templates are ordinary files you can edit. HTML provides navigation, "
#| "search, code highlighting, diagrams, and equations. PDF books provide "
#| "chapters, cross-references, figures, indexes, and language-aware "
#| "typesetting."
msgid ""
"The project contains ``conf.toml``, ``index.rst``, "
"``_templates/layout.html``, ``_templates/book.typ``, and ``_static/``. "
"Templates are ordinary files we can edit. HTML provides navigation, "
"search, code highlighting, diagrams, and equations. PDF books provide "
"chapters, cross-references, figures, indexes, and language-aware "
"typesetting."
msgstr ""
"परियोजना में `conf.toml`, `index.rst`, `_templates/layout.html`, "
"`_templates/book.typ` और `_static/` होते हैं। टेम्पलेट सामान्य फ़ाइलें "
"हैं जिन्हें सीधे बदल सकते हैं। HTML में नेविगेशन, खोज, कोड हाइलाइटिंग, "
"आरेख और समीकरण मिलते हैं। PDF में अध्याय, पार-संदर्भ, चित्र, इंडेक्स और "
"भाषा के अनुसार टाइपसेटिंग मिलती है।"

#: ../../repository.rst:32
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The default theme is light. Readers can choose dark or the system "
#| "theme. The manual detects the browser language on its landing page and "
#| "repository overview. A saved choice takes precedence; direct links to "
#| "an edition or chapter remain explicit requests."
msgid ""
"The default theme is light. Readers can choose dark or the system theme. "
"The manual detects the browser language on its landing page and "
"repository overview. A saved choice takes precedence. Direct links to an "
"edition or chapter remain explicit requests."
msgstr ""
"डिफ़ॉल्ट थीम हल्की है; गहरी या सिस्टम थीम भी चुन सकते हैं। मैनुअल के "
"मुख्य पृष्ठ और रिपॉज़िटरी परिचय पर ब्राउज़र की भाषा चुनी जाती है। सहेजी "
"गई पसंद पहले लागू होती है। किसी भाषा या अध्याय के सीधे लिंक की पसंद नहीं "
"बदली जाती।"

#: ../../repository.rst:42
msgid "Install"
msgstr "स्थापित करें"

#: ../../repository.rst:45
msgid ""
"Each `release <https://github.com/insanai/guidedog/releases>`__ has an "
"archive for Linux, macOS, and Windows, with ``SHA256SUMS``. The Typst "
"compiler and the tree-sitter parsers are compiled into ``guidedog``. "
"Diagrams use the Graphviz library (``libgvc``). Where the system does not "
"provide it, the archive's notes say how to install it. Fetching remote "
"intersphinx inventories and publishing to GitHub Pages run the system's "
"``curl`` program. Check and install the archive:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:58
msgid ""
"The release notes describe each platform's requirements and limits. See "
"the :doc:`installation guide <howto/install>` for the details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:61
msgid "Build from source"
msgstr "स्रोत से बिल्ड करें"

#: ../../repository.rst:64
msgid ""
"Install a Rust toolchain (the workspace's ``rust-version`` or later) and "
"the Graphviz development files (``libgvc``, ``libcgraph``; for example "
"``graphviz-dev`` on Debian and Ubuntu, or ``brew install graphviz``). "
"Then, at the checkout root:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:75
msgid ""
"The ``typst`` crates are a default feature of ``gd-typst``. Without them, "
"Guidedog runs an installed, pinned ``typst`` program for PDF output. "
"`RELEASING.md "
"<https://github.com/insanai/guidedog/blob/main/RELEASING.md>`__ describes "
"the release workflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:80
msgid ""
"The workspace is split by responsibility. The engine crates "
"(``guidedoc``, the readers and renderers, ``guidedoc-defaults``) use only "
"the standard library. Supporting libraries (``gd-toml``, ``gd-json``, "
"``gd-jinja``, ``gd-highlight``, ``gd-gettext``, ``gd-graphdog``, "
"``gd-typst``, ...) never depend on the engine. The project builder and "
"the command line sit above both. The programs are under ``cmd/``. See "
":doc:`Internals <internals/index>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:86
msgid "Translate with Guidedog"
msgstr "Guidedog से अनुवाद"

#: ../../repository.rst:99
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Translate and review `msgstr` values in the PO files. Guidedog "
#| "extracts POT files, merges catalogs, reports progress, and builds each "
#| "edition. It does not invent translations. Commands, paths, code, API "
#| "names, and reference targets stay unchanged. Only the manual and "
#| "repository overview are translated; API and GDS remain English. See "
#| "the [manual build instructions](howto/maintain-docs.rst) for "
#| "assembling all editions and PDF books."
msgid ""
"Translate and review ``msgstr`` values in the PO files. Guidedog extracts "
"POT files, merges catalogs, reports progress, and builds each edition. It "
"does not invent translations. Commands, paths, code, API names, and "
"reference targets stay unchanged. Only the manual and repository overview "
"are translated. API and GDS remain English. See the :doc:`manual build "
"instructions <howto/maintain-docs>` for assembling all editions and PDF "
"books."
msgstr ""
"PO फ़ाइलों में `msgstr` का अनुवाद लिखें और जाँचें। Guidedog POT निकालता "
"है, कैटलॉग मिलाता है, प्रगति बताता है और हर भाषा का संस्करण बनाता है; "
"अनुवाद खुद नहीं लिखता। कमांड, पथ, कोड, API नाम और संदर्भ लक्ष्य न बदलें। "
"केवल मैनुअल और रिपॉज़िटरी परिचय का अनुवाद होता है; API और GDS अंग्रेज़ी "
"में रहते हैं। सारे संस्करण और PDF जोड़ने के लिए [बिल्ड "
"निर्देश](howto/maintain-docs.rst) देखें।"

#: ../../repository.rst:105
msgid "Extend and publish"
msgstr ""

#: ../../repository.rst:108
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Write your own publisher with the {doc}`step-by-step plugin chapter "
#| "<plugins>`. Start with a working folder publisher, then follow the "
#| "real GitHub Pages implementation through ownership, credentials, "
#| "conditional updates and recovery. `guidedog publish --timeout=SECONDS` "
#| "bounds each complete exchange (default: 300 seconds); choose a value "
#| "longer than `--wait`. After an unknown outcome, recover before "
#| "publishing again."
msgid ""
"Write a build plugin or a publisher with the :doc:`step-by-step plugin "
"chapter <plugins>`. A plugin implements one Rust trait. The same value is "
"linked into a custom ``guidedog`` binary with ``gd_cli::run_with``, or "
"served as an installed program with ``gd_plugins::serve_plugin``. The "
"chapter then follows the real GitHub Pages publisher through ownership, "
"credentials, conditional updates and recovery. ``guidedog publish "
"--timeout=SECONDS`` bounds each complete exchange (default: 300 seconds). "
"We choose a value longer than ``--wait``. After an unknown outcome, we "
"recover before publishing again."
msgstr ""
"अपना प्रकाशक लिखने के लिए {doc}`प्लगइन बनाने का चरण-दर-चरण अध्याय "
"<plugins>` पढ़ें। पहले काम करने वाला फ़ोल्डर प्रकाशक चलाएँ, फिर असली "
"GitHub Pages कार्यान्वयन से स्वामित्व, credentials, शर्त के साथ अपडेट और "
"recovery समझें। `guidedog publish --timeout=SECONDS` हर पूरे आदान-प्रदान "
"की समय सीमा है; डिफ़ॉल्ट 300 सेकंड है। इसे `--wait` से अधिक रखें। परिणाम "
"अज्ञात हो तो दोबारा प्रकाशित करने से पहले recovery चलाएँ।"

#: ../../repository.rst:117
msgid "Keep discussions"
msgstr "चर्चाएँ सँभालें"

#: ../../repository.rst:120
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`dsc` keeps proposals and decisions as reStructuredText records, one "
#| "file each, and builds them into a website and PDF books with Guidedog. "
#| "Each catalog has a prefix: Guidedog's design records use `gds`, and "
#| "another project might use `eds`."
msgid ""
"``dsc`` keeps proposals and decisions as reStructuredText records, one "
"file each. It builds them into a website and PDF books with Guidedog. "
"Each catalog has a prefix: Guidedog's design records use ``gds``, and "
"another project might use ``eds``."
msgstr ""
"`dsc` प्रस्तावों और निर्णयों को reStructuredText रिकॉर्ड के रूप में रखता "
"है, हर एक की अलग फ़ाइल, और Guidedog से उनकी वेबसाइट और PDF पुस्तकें बनाता "
"है। हर कैटलॉग का एक उपसर्ग होता है: Guidedog के डिज़ाइन रिकॉर्ड `gds` का "
"उपयोग करते हैं, और कोई दूसरा प्रोजेक्ट `eds` का उपयोग कर सकता है।"

#: ../../repository.rst:133
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A catalog's `discussion.toml` sets its lifecycle states, record types, "
#| "and numbering, and `dsc config` prints it. `dsc` comes in the Guidedog "
#| "archive and builds with the installed `guidedog`. `dscc` is `dsc` with "
#| "Guidedog built in, for a machine with nothing else installed; each "
#| "release has a `dscc` archive for every platform. `guidedog gds` runs "
#| "the same commands on Guidedog's own `docs/gds`. See [Keep a discussion "
#| "catalog](howto/discussions.rst)."
msgid ""
"A catalog's ``discussion.toml`` sets its lifecycle states, record types, "
"and numbering. ``dsc config`` prints it. ``dsc`` comes in the Guidedog "
"archive and builds with the installed ``guidedog``. ``dscc`` is ``dsc`` "
"with Guidedog built in, for a machine with nothing else installed. "
"``guidedog gds`` runs the same commands on Guidedog's own ``docs/gds``. "
"See :doc:`Keep a discussion catalog <howto/discussions>`."
msgstr ""
"कैटलॉग की `discussion.toml` फ़ाइल उसकी जीवनचक्र स्थितियाँ, रिकॉर्ड प्रकार "
"और क्रमांकन तय करती है, और `dsc config` उसे प्रिंट करता है। `dsc` "
"Guidedog आर्काइव में आता है और स्थापित `guidedog` से बिल्ड करता है। "
"`dscc` वह `dsc` है जिसमें Guidedog अंतर्निहित है, उस मशीन के लिए जिस पर "
"और कुछ स्थापित नहीं है; हर रिलीज़ में हर प्लेटफ़ॉर्म के लिए एक `dscc` "
"आर्काइव है। `guidedog gds` वही कमांड Guidedog के अपने `docs/gds` पर चलाता "
"है। [चर्चा कैटलॉग रखना](howto/discussions.rst) देखें।"

